        <detaileddescription>
<para>Register a new attribute key.</para><para>The attribute name is registered with the system and an identifier is returned. The attribute name/ID association is stored in a single, global attribute symbol table. This method throws an <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1Attribute_1_1AlreadyExists" kindref="compound">AlreadyExists</ref> error if the specified name already exists in that global table. Once an attribute is registered its ID never changes and it is never removed from the global attribute symbol table. There is no guarantee that attribute ID numbers are small consecutive integers, although that is how the current implementation works.</para><para>Thread safety: This method is thread safe. </para>        </detaileddescription>
